"P1040629487" "Wyvern agents known to work with Professor Echo have been seen observing two unused Arachnos bases. They have yet to take direct action. I want you to investigate those bases. Find out why they're interested in them. Obliterate anyone who might stand in your way. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you do that?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P870514090" "Do it"
// SendOffString :
"P3006122536" "Good. That's why you make the big money. <br>Your mission profile is simple: <br>The base should be empty. If it's not, destroy all opposition until it is. See if you can discover why Wyvern and Echo are interested in these two bases. Report to me when you're done."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P530338872" "Defeat any intruders in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3302082667" "Whatever is in that old base has no reason to be there anymore. Eliminate it. Look for a reason why Wyvern's interested. Then talk to me. You got it?"

